<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
  <head><%= render "layouts/head" %></head>
  <body style="background:#0B1C33">
    <div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-10">
      <div class="w-full max-w-[420px]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 justify-center mb-7">
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl grid place-items-center text-white font-bold text-lg"
               style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#3E7AC9,#2E6BC0)">X</div>
          <div class="text-white">
            <div class="font-bold text-[17px] leading-tight"><%= current_workspace.name %></div>
            <div class="text-[12px]" style="color:#6B87AC"><%= current_workspace.tagline.presence || "Xstudio" %></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="x-card" style="border-color:#17395F;background:#FFFFFF">
          <div class="p-7">
            <%= render "layouts/flash" %>
            <%= yield %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-center mt-6 text-[12.5px]" style="color:#6B87AC">
          Công cụ làm việc nội bộ · chỉ dành cho thành viên được mời
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
